This license covers the SeerCat programs (panel "seercat" and agent "seercat-agent"), the installer
scripts (panel.sh, agent.sh) and related files published at gokele/SeerCat-releases (the "Software").
By downloading, installing or using the Software you agree to this license.

1. Grant. Subject to this license, you may, free of charge: (a) install and run the Software on
   servers you own or are authorized to manage, without limit on the number of installations;
   (b) use the Software to operate your own forwarding services, for personal use or paid commercial
   operation; (c) keep copies for backup or your own use. The license is non-exclusive,
   non-transferable and non-sublicensable.

2. Restrictions. You may not: (a) sell, resell, rent or lend the Software, or charge for the Software
   itself in any form (including bundling it as software in another product or service, or paid
   "install SeerCat for you" services); (b) distribute, re-host, mirror or otherwise provide the
   Software or any part of it to third parties, including republishing it on other websites, file
   hosts, code repositories or mirrors (sharing the official download links is allowed);
   (c) sublicense or transfer the Software; (d) modify the Software or remove copyright, license or
   attribution notices; (e) use the Software, its name or logo to imply endorsement by the author.
   These restrictions do not limit rights that applicable law expressly grants you.

3. Third-party components. The Software contains code based on third-party open source projects,
   including flux-panel (Apache License 2.0) and gost (MIT License). Their notices and full license
   texts are in THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES and NOTICE. Those components remain under their own licenses,
   and nothing here limits your rights under those licenses for the components as obtained from
   their original projects.

4. Lawful use. You are responsible for using the Software in compliance with applicable laws.
   Using it for network attacks, data theft, unauthorized access or any unlawful purpose is prohibited.

5. Disclaimer. THE SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND. TO THE MAXIMUM EXTENT
   PERMITTED BY LAW, THE AUTHOR SHALL NOT BE LIABLE FOR ANY DAMAGES ARISING FROM THE USE OF OR
   INABILITY TO USE THE SOFTWARE.

6. Termination. Your rights under this license terminate automatically if you breach it; you must
   then stop using and delete all copies. New versions may come with an updated license.

7. All rights not expressly granted are reserved by the author.
